Author: Rob Massatti [aut, cre, cph],
    Daniel E. Winkler [ctb],
    U.S. Geological Survey [cph]
Maintainer: Rob Massatti <rob@landscollective.org>
Description: A maintained successor to POPMAPS for estimating ancestry
    coefficients and ancestry probability surfaces from empirical genetic data
    across user-defined geospatial layers. The current development version
    preserves the POPMAPS 1.03 workflow while package infrastructure,
    documentation, tests, and spatial-performance improvements are added.
URL: https://github.com/landscollective/popmaps2
